# Allow-list: send only what ruview/Dockerfile copies. RuView's vendored
# crates are large (vendor/ruvector alone is ~390 MB with tests and assets).
*
!ruview/rootfs/
!ruview-src/v2/Cargo.toml
!ruview-src/v2/Cargo.lock
!ruview-src/v2/crates/
!ruview-src/v2/vendor/security/
!ruview-src/vendor/ruvector/
!ruview-src/vendor/rufield/
!ruview-src/ui/
**/.git
**/target
**/node_modules
